  (text "POWER — parallel diode-OR (pinmap §4n), no regulator. VIN abs max 17 V: 12 V adapters yes, 18 V no." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 7.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a6a83689-b99d-5ef5-989e-6c4d94908507"))
  (text "Rail = VIN (≈8.6 V battery / ≈11.6 V adapter). Battery − returns via the OUT ring (the power switch)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c0353730-ab02-56cb-80a3-f5db9787609a"))
  (text "+9VA: RC-filtered op-amp rail (brief §3.4)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 121.92 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a346ac5d-c011-502a-b705-5fddf074221c"))
  (text "GROUND STAR — NT1 is the single AGND↔DGND join (pinmap §4l). Place at the power-entry corner." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 121.92 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "eb897b85-e576-5a05-ab80-cb5b8024d0e9"))
  (text "DAISY SEED3 — pin numbers per daisy/board.h. Unused GPIO marked NC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fdf93890-d1d3-5bd9-b09b-3cdda6b88e8f"))
  (text "USB: the Seed's own USB-C port via the panel extender — no board connection (D29/D30 NC)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a11a1c51-32c0-56a8-a302-e03b0b7ae950"))
  (text "FRONT END CH A — Seed3 Fig 3.3 (RF stopper · unity follower · pole+pad · inverting unity · 100R+33n), Vref = rev D 2.7 V. Rin 1 M (K&K 24.5 nF → 6.5 Hz)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3d970171-77d9-5442-b0d2-510859db161e"))
  (text "Second stage inverts → firmware flips the sign (brief §3.1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 167.64 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "373188f2-0f41-5bd0-b4b7-f8cecc3d9f42"))
  (text "FRONT END CH B — Seed3 Fig 3.3 (RF stopper · unity follower · pole+pad · inverting unity · 100R+33n), Vref = rev D 2.7 V. Rin 1 M (K&K 24.5 nF → 6.5 Hz)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a7f9dbce-7a97-5fa0-b6cc-7eca99e82fa2"))
  (text "Second stage inverts → firmware flips the sign (brief §3.1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 167.64 289.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a7c8deaf-444e-5526-8ba5-92ff02dea81b"))
  (text "VREF — rev D bias: 1 M / 470 k from +9VA → 2.7 V. Buffered by U3B." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 342.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8362964d-8373-5570-b54a-c70045cfa9d6"))
  (text "OUTPUT — Seed3 Fig 3.6 instrument-level stage, UNITY (Rin = Rf1 15k, Rf2 0R link; fit 18k for +7 dB). 100R source, 10u/10k out. OUT ring = battery −." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 111.76 335.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3c86c38f-f788-501b-aa84-1e63405b1021"))
  (text "OP-AMP POWER — +9VA / AGND, 100n at each chip." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 383.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "395f6533-eed8-541b-8a09-68810ac57842"))
  (text "OLED 1.3\" SH1106 I²C module on a 7-pin socket. DC + CS hard to GND → 0x3C (board.h). 33R series at the Seed, 4k7 pull-ups at the header (brief §3.6)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.0 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "74c01aaa-5551-56e3-a392-54f9dc8c9361"))
  (text "ENCODER — PEC11R, board-mounted. A/B/SW pulled up 10k, 10n debounce. ⚠ bushing must not bond to the casting (brief §2)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.0 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6d8b4a27-0537-55c1-b0ea-ed5b64bdeee4"))
  (text "FOOTSWITCHES — panel-mounted momentary SPST on JST 2-pin leads. 10k pull-up + 100n. LEFT = bypass (D25), RIGHT = tuner (D21)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.0 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bb0c6fc9-9512-5f5e-a059-8823d2e72b87"))
  (text "STATUS LEDs — D19 = bypass/engaged, D20 = looper/record. 3 mm through the face; shape/position distinguish them, not colour." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.0 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "436171c1-37a6-5df5-a3c4-2101cac46c36"))
  (text "microSD — push-push socket ON THE SDMMC PINS (D1–D6). Bit-bang SPI fallback = 4 pin numbers in sd_spi.h: CS=D1 MOSI=D5 SCK=D6 MISO=D4 (brief §3.7)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.0 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "73ca9f2f-f13e-508a-8a72-49feecd95464"))
  (text "TEST POINTS — every pad has an adjacent GND pad on the layout (feedback_design_for_probeability)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.0 307.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "11e70408-985d-530a-954f-0664e0517762"))
